apulsator audio filter (src/audio/apulsator.ts)

src/audio/apulsator.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_apulsator.c: the
level_in, level_out, mode, amount, offset_l, offset_r, width, timing, bpm, ms
and hz option table with its ranges, defaults and named constants, the packed
double stereo format and layout list (query_formats), the LFO frequency for
the bpm, ms and hz timings (config_input), the SimpleLFO phase advance and the
triangle, square, sawup and sawdown waveforms (lfo_advance, lfo_get_value),
and the per-sample gain loop with both LFO phases carried across frames
(filter_frame).

